Reply to Goal 1: Deliver High-Impact Solutions
I successfully delivered end-to-end solutions for four critical modules, including Currency Master, Rate Change, and the complex Journal Posting system. These implementations covered the full lifecycle of data handling and were built to be reliable and scalable, ensuring all business requirements were met within the assigned timelines.
​Reply to Goal 2: System Improvement & Business Alignment
I optimized the Journal Posting workflow, reducing batch processing time from 20 minutes to 4 minutes. This was achieved by implementing InputStream for efficient memory usage, In-memory lookups for faster validation, and Stored Procedures to minimize database calls. I also utilized @Async for background parallel executions and added MDC for improved tracing, significantly enhancing system performance and stability.